{"language":"en","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","锐锋绝杀"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/en","Piercing Onslaught"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","击晕目标格各方向直线上的所有敌人并造成伤害，结束后释放英勇冲锋。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/en","Estrilda stuns and deals damage to all enemies along different straight paths crossing the target tile. She casts Ride Down when the skill ends."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","爱丝特瑞达选择一个地图格，从三个方向朝目标格沿直线路径贯穿战场向其冲锋。前两次冲锋过程中对路径上的敌人造成240% + 32% ATK的伤害并使其眩晕2秒，最后一次冲锋从敌方阵营边界冲向我方阵营边界，对路径上的敌人造成360% + 48% ATK伤害并使其眩晕3秒。爱丝特瑞达在冲锋过程中处于无敌状态。\n技能结束后，爱丝特瑞达会跳向沿轴线方向敌人数量最多的我方阵营边界格，再次释放英勇冲锋。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Estrilda targets a tile and charges across the battlefield toward it three times, each time along a different straight path. Each of the first two charges deals 240% + 32% ATK damage to enemies in her path and stuns them for 2s. The final charge goes from the enemy edge of the battlefield to the allied edge of the battlefield, dealing 360% + 48% ATK damage to enemies in her path and stunning them for 3s. Estrilda is invincible during these charges.\nAfter the skill ends, Estrilda leaps to the allied edge of the battlefield, landing on the tile whose axis line covers the most enemies, and casts Ride Down."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":57,"end":63,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":113,"end":119,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":165,"end":171,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":341,"end":347,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"keyword:standardline"},{"start":53,"end":67,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":87,"end":91,"tooltip_key":"keyword:sideborderline"},{"start":95,"end":99,"tooltip_key":"keyword:sideborderline"},{"start":109,"end":123,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":146,"end":148,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"},{"start":180,"end":184,"tooltip_key":"keyword:sideborderline"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":110,"end":123,"tooltip_key":"keyword:standardline"},{"start":161,"end":175,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":266,"end":289,"tooltip_key":"keyword:sideborderline"},{"start":304,"end":327,"tooltip_key":"keyword:sideborderline"},{"start":337,"end":351,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":420,"end":430,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"},{"start":504,"end":527,"tooltip_key":"keyword:sideborderline"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","前两次冲锋造成的伤害提升至260% + 32% ATK，最后一次冲锋造成的伤害提升至390% + 48% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage of each of the first two charges to 260% + 32% ATK and the final charge to 390% + 48% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":46,"end":52,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":61,"end":67,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":100,"end":106,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":42,"end":56,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":57,"end":71,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":96,"end":110,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","前两次冲锋造成的伤害提升至280% + 32% ATK，最后一次冲锋造成的伤害提升至420% + 48% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage of each of the first two charges to 280% + 32% ATK and the final charge to 420% + 48% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":46,"end":52,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":61,"end":67,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":100,"end":106,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":42,"end":56,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":57,"end":71,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":96,"end":110,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","前两次冲锋造成的伤害提升至300% + 32% ATK，最后一次冲锋造成的伤害提升至450% + 48% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage of each of the first two charges to 300% + 32% ATK and the final charge to 450% + 48% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":46,"end":52,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":61,"end":67,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":100,"end":106,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":42,"end":56,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":57,"end":71,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":96,"end":110,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","前两次冲锋造成的伤害提升至320% + 32% ATK，最后一次冲锋造成的伤害提升至480% + 48% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage of each of the first two charges to 320% + 32% ATK and the final charge to 480% + 48% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":46,"end":52,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":61,"end":67,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":100,"end":106,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":42,"end":56,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":57,"end":71,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":96,"end":110,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","冲锋陷阵"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/en","Gallant Charge"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时冲向敌方阵营，击退并挑飞路径上的敌人并造成伤害，主动释放时对周围的敌人造成范围伤害。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/en","Estrilda charges toward the enemy side of the battlefield when a battle starts, dealing damage to enemies in her path, knocking them back and into the air. When this skill is used actively, Estrilda deals AoE damage to nearby enemies."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，爱丝特瑞达会使用“英勇冲锋”：短暂蓄力后快速向前冲锋至敌方阵营边界，冲锋过程中对路径上的敌人造成220% + 28% ATK伤害，同时将沿途的敌人沿冲锋方向击退，直到途径其他敌人时切换击退目标，直到战场边界。被击退至战场边界的敌人会被挑飞，额外受到320% + 32% ATK伤害并被倒地3秒。爱丝特瑞达在“英勇冲锋”过程中处于霸体状态。\n主动使用时，爱丝特瑞达使用骑枪横扫敌人，对周围一格的敌人造成180% + 24% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/en","When a battle starts, Estrilda casts Ride Down.\nRide Down: After a brief wind-up, Estrilda charges to the enemy edge of the battlefield, dealing 220% + 28% ATK damage to enemies in her path. She pushes the first enemy she strikes forward along her path. If she collides with another enemy, she switches targets and pushes the new enemy instead, continuing until she reaches the edge. The enemy pushed to the edge is knocked into the air, taking 320% + 32% ATK extra damage before being knocked down for 3s. Estrilda remains unaffected throughout the process.\nActive. Estrilda sweeps her lance, dealing 180% + 24% ATK damage to adjacent enemies."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":58,"end":64,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":134,"end":140,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":210,"end":216,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":149,"end":155,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":449,"end":455,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":606,"end":612,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":35,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"keyword:sideborderline"},{"start":54,"end":68,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":130,"end":144,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":170,"end":172,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":206,"end":220,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":112,"end":135,"tooltip_key":"keyword:sideborderline"},{"start":145,"end":159,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":445,"end":459,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":524,"end":534,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":602,"end":616,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“英勇冲锋”对路径上的敌人造成的伤害提升至240% + 28% ATK，骑枪横扫造成的伤害提升至200% + 24% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases Ride Down's damage to enemies in the path to 240% + 28% ATK and the lance sweep's damage to 200% + 24% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":25,"end":31,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":52,"end":58,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":59,"end":65,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":106,"end":112,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":35,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":48,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":55,"end":69,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":102,"end":116,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“英勇冲锋”对路径上的敌人造成的伤害提升至260% + 28% ATK，骑枪横扫造成的伤害提升至220% + 24% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases Ride Down's damage to enemies in the path to 260% + 28% ATK and the lance sweep's damage to 220% + 24% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":25,"end":31,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":52,"end":58,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":59,"end":65,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":106,"end":112,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":35,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":48,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":55,"end":69,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":102,"end":116,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“英勇冲锋”对路径上的敌人造成的伤害提升至280% + 28% ATK，骑枪横扫造成的伤害提升至240% + 24% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases Ride Down's damage to enemies in the path to 280% + 28% ATK and the lance sweep's damage to 240% + 24% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":25,"end":31,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":52,"end":58,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":59,"end":65,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":106,"end":112,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":35,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":48,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":55,"end":69,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":102,"end":116,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","骑枪绝技"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/en","Lance Flurry"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","对敌人造成多段伤害，并降低其攻击力。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/en","Estrilda deals damage to enemies multiple times and reduces their ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","爱丝特瑞达用骑枪发动迅捷连击，对目标敌人造成7段40% + 5% ATK伤害并使其降低30% + 3%攻击力，持续12秒，若自身处于敌方阵营边界，则每段攻击额外造成10% + 2% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Estrilda unleashes a rapid series of lance strikes against an enemy, dealing 40% + 5% ATK damage 7 times and reducing their ATK by 30% + 3% for 12s. If she is at the enemy edge of the battlefield, each hit deals 10% + 2% ATK extra damage."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":27,"end":32,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":46,"end":51,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":85,"end":90,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":80,"end":85,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":134,"end":139,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":215,"end":220,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":24,"end":36,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":68,"end":72,"tooltip_key":"keyword:sideborderline"},{"start":82,"end":94,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":77,"end":89,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":172,"end":195,"tooltip_key":"keyword:sideborderline"},{"start":212,"end":224,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每段连击造成的伤害提升至45% + 5% ATK，敌人的攻击力降低比例提升至30% + 3%。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases damage per hit to 45% + 5% ATK and the ATK reduction to 30% + 3%."],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":41,"end":46,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":31,"end":36,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":69,"end":74,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":28,"end":40,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每段连击造成的伤害提升至50% + 5% ATK，敌人的攻击力降低比例提升至30% + 3%。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases damage per hit to 50% + 5% ATK and the ATK reduction to 30% + 3%."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":41,"end":46,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":31,"end":36,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":69,"end":74,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":28,"end":40,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每段连击造成的伤害提升至55% + 5% ATK，敌人的攻击力降低比例提升至30% + 3%。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases damage per hit to 55% + 5% ATK and the ATK reduction to 30% + 3%."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":41,"end":46,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":31,"end":36,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":69,"end":74,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":28,"end":40,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/en","Hero Focus"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身攻击力。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/en","Increases ATK."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升12%。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Increases ATK by 12% during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升16%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases ATK by 16% during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升20%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases ATK by 20% during battle."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","荣光战旗"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/en","Pennon of Valor"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","插下战旗使附近的友军提升攻击力，降低所受到的伤害。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/en","Estrilda plants a Pennon of Valor that increases nearby allies' ATK and reduces their damage taken."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","当爱丝特瑞达通过“英勇冲锋”抵达敌方阵营边界时，在原地插下半径2格的荣光战旗持续15秒，在战旗范围内的友军提升30%攻击力，并且受到的伤害降低20%。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Whenever Ride Down brings Estrilda to the enemy edge of the battlefield, she plants a Pennon of Valor at her position for 15s. Allies within 2 tiles of the Pennon gain 30% ATK and take 20% reduced damage."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"keyword:sideborderline"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":48,"end":71,"tooltip_key":"keyword:sideborderline"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","处于荣光战旗范围内的友军的攻击力提升比例提高至35%，受到的伤害降低比例提升至22%。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the ATK bonus granted to allies within the Pennon of Valor's range to 35% and the damage reduction to 22%."],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","当“英勇冲锋”成功击退敌人到敌方阵营边界时，爱丝特瑞达会标记目标敌人，使其在15秒内受到的伤害提升25%。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Estrilda marks any enemy she pushes to the enemy edge of the battlefield with Ride Down. Marked enemies take 25% increased damage for 15s."],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"keyword:sideborderline"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":49,"end":72,"tooltip_key":"keyword:sideborderline"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","处于荣光战旗范围内的友军的攻击力提升比例提高至40%，受到的伤害降低比例提升至24%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases the ATK bonus granted to allies within the Pennon of Valor's range to 40% and the damage reduction to 24%."],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/en","Enhance Force"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","锐锋绝杀结束后回复生命和护盾，英勇冲锋结束后提升攻击力和穿透。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/en","Estrilda recovers HP and gains a shield after Piercing Onslaught ends. She increases her ATK and Penetration after Ride Down ends."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","爱丝特瑞达释放“锐锋绝杀”结束后回复300% ATK生命，同时获得300% ATK护盾；释放“英勇冲锋”结束后提高30点穿透和30%攻击力，持续10秒。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/en","After Piercing Onslaught ends, Estrilda recovers 300% ATK HP and gains a 300% ATK shield. After Ride Down ends, she gains 30 Penetration and 30% ATK for 10s."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":33,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":49,"end":57,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":73,"end":81,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","英毅骑枪"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/en","Valiant Lance"]]}